{
  "name": "CRM · Email reply → follow-up task",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reply follow-up\nSubscribe this Webhook to `email.replied` (needs IMAP sync on in the CRM). Creates a task due in 2 hours for the contact owner and moves new leads to *qualified*.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create an API key in the CRM (Integrations → API keys).\n2. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential named `CRM API key`: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer agp_…`.\n3. Select that credential on every *CRM* HTTP Request node.\n4. Set `crm_url` in the **CRM config** node.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "a0ffd885-2293-5e58-b070-6da5113eb805",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -330
      ]
    },
